{
  "uid": "edutrack-overview",
  "title": "EduTrack — Estado y diagnóstico",
  "tags": [
    "edutrack",
    "overview"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Disponibilidad interna por endpoint",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Sondas dentro de Docker; no verifican DNS, Cloudflare ni login desde Internet.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "probe_success{job=\"blackbox-http\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NO DISPONIBLE",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "DISPONIBLE",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Fuentes de métricas disponibles",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "0 = no se puede recolectar. Exporter disponible no implica servicio saludable.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "up",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · {{instance}}",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "NO DISPONIBLE",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "DISPONIBLE",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Tráfico backend sin sondas (req/s)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Excluye /health, /ready y /metrics. Incluye automatizaciones y usuarios; no representa usuarios únicos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(edutrack_backend_http_requests_total{job=\"edutrack-backend\",route!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Respuestas 5xx backend / solicitudes",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Ventana 5 minutos. Sin solicitudes no hay proporción calculable. Abrir Backend para ver rutas y volumen.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(sum(rate(edutrack_backend_http_requests_total{job=\"edutrack-backend\",route!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or (0 * sum(rate(edutrack_backend_http_requests_total{job=\"edutrack-backend\",route!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[5m])))) / (sum(rate(edutrack_backend_http_requests_total{job=\"edutrack-backend\",route!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[5m])) > 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Backend p95 sin sondas",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "Estimación basada en histograma; con poco tráfico no es representativa. No mide latencia del navegador.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95,sum by (le) (rate(edutrack_backend_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"edutrack-backend\",route!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[5m])))",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Problemas detectados por Prometheus",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "pending = condición en evaluación; firing = superó la duración. Sin filas puede significar ninguna alerta: comprobar primero las fuentes. Los avisos gestionados por Grafana están en Alerting → Alert rules.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=~\"pending|firing\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Espacio disponible por disco",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Si desciende, revisar retención, volúmenes y crecimiento antes de borrar datos.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{job=\"node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs|proc|sysfs|devtmpfs\"} / node_filesystem_size_bytes{job=\"node\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay|squashfs|proc|sysfs|devtmpfs\"}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{mountpoint}}",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Memoria disponible del servidor",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Revisar Servidor y Docker para localizar consumo; no confundir caché recuperable con memoria agotada.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{job=\"node\"}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cómo actuar",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**1. Disponibilidad:** si falla /ready, revisar dependencias y PostgreSQL. Si falla /health, revisar backend.\n\n**2. Errores o lentitud:** abrir Backend y luego Logs manteniendo el período.\n\n**3. Seguridad:** revisar WAF y CrowdSec; una detección no confirma intrusión.\n\n**4. Sin datos:** revisar la fuente antes de interpretar ceros. La disponibilidad externa y los recorridos autenticados aún no están cubiertos por estas sondas."
      }
    }
  ],
